OL,3,GNEWSATwo men re-arrested after death of
OL,4,Asoldier
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been re-arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of manslaughter after the
OL,8,Fbody of a soldier was found in a river.
OL,10,FNorthumbria Police recovered the body
OL,11,Fof Liam Potts, 22, who served with the
OL,12,FColdstream Guards, close to Wylam
OL,13,FBridge on 18 August.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
