OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATwo men re-arrested after death of
OL,4,Asoldier
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrior to his disappearance in the early
OL,7,Fhours of 15 August, the force said it
OL,8,Freceived reports of a disturbance at
OL,9,FThe Boathouse pub and a subsequent
OL,10,Fcollision at the bridge between a car
OL,11,Fand group of pedestrians. Police are
OL,12,Finvestigating whether the incidents are
OL,13,Flinked to the soldier entering the
OL,14,Fwater.
OL,16,FTwo men, aged 22 and 23, have been
OL,17,Fre-arrested on suspicion of
OL,18,Fmanslaughter and released on bail as
OL,19,Finquiries continue.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
